---
title: Training Stage Insight
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Admin SPA
    participant API as /recognition/training-stage
    participant Session as AsyncSession
    participant DB as identity_clusters + media_identities
    participant Settings as ClusteringSettingsModel

    Client->>API: GET training-stage?tenant_id=
    API->>Session: set_tenant_context()
    API->>DB: count labeled clusters (label not null, not cluster-*)
    API->>DB: count all clusters + identities
    API->>Settings: compute_adaptive_threshold(labeled_count)
    API-->>Client: stage, stage_label, cluster_count, identity_count,\ncurrent_threshold, base_threshold, strict_threshold, maturity_point, progress_percent
